  "poet": "பல புலவர்கள்",
  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "குடநீரட் டுண்ணும் இடுக்கட் பொழுதும்\nகடனீ ரறவுண்ணும் கேளிர் வரினும்\nகடனீர்மை கையாறாக் கொள்ளு மடமொழி\nமாதர் மனைமாட்சி யாள்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "A true wife, in time of poverty, if friends come in enough to drink up the sea, performs her duties with kindness of speech. When in the straitened time they cook and eat with but one pot of water on the hearth,— if relatives arrive enough to drain the sea, the soft-voiced dame, the glory of her home, well fulfils each seemly duty.",
